  "name": "Question 18",
  "problem": "Simplify $\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta .$",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n1={csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta \n$$\n\nSubstituting the above identity into the given expression, and then factoring it as a difference of squares, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta  & =\\frac{{csc}^{2}\u2061\\theta -{cot}^{2}\u2061\\theta }{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{(\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta )\\,(\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta )}{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta }-\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{(\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta )}\\,(\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta +\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta )}{\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta -\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta }}-\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta  \\\\  & =\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta }+\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta -\\cancel{\\operatorname{csc}\u2061\\theta } \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}\u2061\\theta .\\end{aligned}\n$$",
